# Large 3D avatar assets — host off-repo (Cloudinary) and point
# VITE_AVATAR_GLB_URL at the CDN URL. Cloudflare Pages rejects files >25 MiB,
# and big binaries bloat git history. See scripts/check-public-asset-sizes.mjs.
apps/web/public/avatar/*.glb
